<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SALAMANCA SIGN CROATIAN PAVLICIC.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SALAMANCA SIGN CROATIAN PAVLICIC.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly-promoted Salamanca confirmed on Monday that they had signed Croatian international defender Dubravko Pavlicic.</p>
<p>Pavlicic has played in Spain for the last three years with Hercules, relegated last season.</p>
<p>Salamanca officials also said Italian Marco Lanna had joined from Roma.</p>
